  m_Name: tutorial_movement
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: tutorial_movement
  title: Moving Around
  body: 'The farmer moves one tile at a time across the farm grid.


    To get him
    to move, open the coding panel and drag a Move block into a new column. Use the
    dropdown to choose a cardinal direction, then hit Run to watch him move. You
    can chain multiple blocks together or use loops to get the farmer to walk further.


    Try
    moving the farmer on top of a Crop tile, then I''ll tell you all about farming.'
  trigger: 0
  thresholdResource: 0
  thresholdAmount: 0
